          "title": "Dinner in Galway",
          "description": "Habla de lo que pasará si…: primer condicional, when, as soon as y unless. Y question tags con todos los tiempos: You'll come back, won't you?",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "lesson_id": "galway_family_lesson",
              "title": "First conditional and time clauses",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "phase": "context",
                  "type": "audio_context",
                  "content": {
                    "title": "Dinner in Galway",
                    "dialogue": [
                      {
                        "speaker": "Maureen",
                        "text": "Lucía, love, have some more potatoes. If you don't eat, I'll be offended!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Thank you, Maureen. If I eat any more, I won't be able to move!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "Mam, leave her alone. So, what are we doing tomorrow?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Maureen",
                        "text": "If the weather's good, you should take her to the Cliffs of Moher."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "And if it rains?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Maureen",
                        "text": "If it rains, you'll get wet! This is Ireland, Daniel."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "I don't mind the rain. I've got my red umbrella."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Maureen",
                        "text": "Good girl. And when you come back, I'll make my famous apple tart."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "As soon as we get back, I'll put the kettle on."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Maureen",
                        "text": "Lucía, will you come again in the summer?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "I'd love to. If Daniel invites me!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "Unless she gets tired of me first."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Maureen",
                        "text": "Sure, she won't get tired of you. You're a grand lad."
                      }
                    ],
                    "passage": "Two days later, in Galway. Daniel's mother, Maureen, has made a huge dinner. Outside, the rain is hitting the windows."
                  }
